_fix = {1: 'A bakery wants 50 new customers from one creator post. At 12 per customer it sets a cap of 600, tells the creator the target in the brief, and checks after two weeks that cost per customer stayed under 12.', 4: "A fitness coach agrees a flat fee of 200 plus 5 per sign-up the creator brings. If 20 people join, the creator earns 300 in total; the agreement also says each post must carry a clear 'paid partnership' label.", 6: 'A book shop spends 240 across three creators and gets 48 orders. Cost per order is 5.00; one creator drove 30 orders at 3.20 and the other two 9.00 each, so next round the shop rebooks the first creator.'}
