C['intro_add'] = ['After this module you can describe the main creator types and sponsored-post model, so you choose partners by fit and trust instead of follower counts alone.', 'You will turn a vague wish into one measurable campaign goal with a budget and deadline, which lets you judge every later choice against it.', 'You will be able to screen creators for real engagement and matching audiences, which protects your budget from inflated accounts and mismatched followers.', "You will write a one-page brief that sets clear boundaries yet leaves creative room, so the resulting posts sound natural to the creator's audience.", 'You will draft a written agreement covering deliverables, dates, content rights and payment steps, so both you and the creator know what happens when plans change.', 'You will launch with tracked links, check each live post against the agreement and fix problems quickly, keeping the campaign accurate and the creators properly disclosed.', 'You will calculate cost per result for each creator and read the numbers after a fair waiting period, so your next campaign rests on evidence, not impressions.', "You will assemble a media kit and a disclosure habit for your own channel, which keeps your audience's trust while you accept paid partnerships."]
